@K51_EGG_PROJECT_NAME(ARG)
;Returns the name of Nitori's current or previous project, a flavor mechanic that she'll bring up in dialogue.
;Every project has a set number of days to complete, at which point she'll announce that it's done and move on to a new one.
;The projects will progress in order until they're exhausted, at which point they'll cycle randomly as revamps.
;Some interactions might reference certain projects, such as combat training and the event to help Nitori build a prototype.
;Other than this, there are no gameplay effects, it's just for consistency in the dialogue and to give a sense of progression.
#FUNCTIONS
IF ARG == 1
	LOCAL = CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PREVIOUS_PROJECT
ELSE
	LOCAL = CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECT
ENDIF
SELECTCASE LOCAL
	;The -1 case is never the current project, just the first previous project.
	CASE -1
		RETURNF "Nessie"
