;Child-handling functions for the purpose of getting around TW's limitations regarding children.
;Each child's character is derived from a combination of personality and hobby. For the first five children, these are unique and designed to fit each other. Subsequent ones are shuffled.
;They aren't actual variables, instead being assigned within the checking functions based on the child's number.

@K51_EGG_CHILD_PERSONALITY(ChildIndex)
;Each personality type is based on a different talent in the game. The first two are Nitori's own talents, the rest are chosen to complement her.
;All of them have the trademark mania and intelligence of kappa even though they're half-breeds.
;Curious: Always poking stuff, asking questions, experimenting with stuff. Sometimes more scientist than engineer, often leaves projects unfinished.
;Timid: Tries to stay out of the way, doesn't speak up much, more creative than technical. Builds gadgets with personality.
;Brave (Male): Does ill-advised experiments and makes dangerous gadgets, doesn't respect boundaries or understand warning labels.
;Shameless (Female): No filter, does and says whatever she wants, dresses poorly or not at all, doesn't respect rules.
;Moody: Short fuse, breaks stuff a lot. Doesn't handle pressure well. Perfectionist, achieves good results from sheer dedication and fury.
;Liberated: Extremely honest about everything, does things at their own pace in their own way, respects rules when they feel like it. Creative and occasionally extreme.
#FUNCTIONS
#DIM DYNAMIC ChildIndex
#DIMS DYNAMIC CheckPersonality
WHILE 1
SELECTCASE CheckPersonality
	CASE ""
		CheckPersonality '= "Curious"
	CASE "Curious"
		CheckPersonality '= "Timid"
	CASE "Timid"
		CheckPersonality '= "Brave"
	CASE "Brave"
		CheckPersonality '= "Shameless"
	CASE "Shameless"
		CheckPersonality '= "Moody"
	CASE "Moody"
		CheckPersonality '= "Liberated"
	CASE "Liberated"
		; [AUTO-NEUTRALIZED] THROW @K51_EGG_CHILD_PERSONALITY error with ChildIndex {ChildIndex}, personality was not assigned.
ENDSELECT
SIF CHILD_TRAIT(51,ChildIndex,CheckPersonality)
	RETURNF CheckPersonality
WEND

@K51_EGG_CHILD_SET_PERSONALITY(ChildIndex)
#DIM DYNAMIC ChildIndex
#DIMS DYNAMIC ChildPersonality
SIF CHILD_TRAIT(51,ChildIndex,"Curious,Timid,Brave,Shameless,Moody,Liberated")
	RETURN
$TOP
SELECTCASE RAND:5
	CASE 0
		ChildPersonality '= "Curious"
	CASE 1
		ChildPersonality '= "Timid"
	CASE 2
		IF CHILD_SEX:51:ChildIndex == 2
			ChildPersonality '= "Brave"
		ELSE
			ChildPersonality '= "Shameless"
		ENDIF
	CASE 3
		ChildPersonality '= "Moody"
	CASE 4
		ChildPersonality '= "Liberated"
ENDSELECT
SIF CFLAG:51:子供人数 < 6 && FIND_CHILD("51",,ChildPersonality) ;The first five children will have unique personalities.
	GOTO TOP
CALL ADD_CHILD_TRAIT(51,ChildIndex,ChildPersonality)

@K51_EGG_CHILD_HOBBY(ChildIndex)
;All of Nitori's children will be into engineering in one way or another. Their hobby decides how they go about it, and their specific interest.
;Like with personality, there is one hobby each exclusive to male and female, in the fourth slot (3).
;Robotics: Fascinated by autonomous machines and complex workings, and wants to build them. Adores Ruukoto.
;Architecture: Likes buildings, especially kappa buildings designed to stay hidden. Dreams of building a base inside the human village.
;Explosives: Loves the kaboom. Makes the kaboom. Would probably die quickly if they weren't at least half youkai.
;Weapons (Male): Water guns, rockets, swords, and more. A man of action, who solves problems with violence.
;Danmaku (Female): More about the art of violence than the result. Expresses herself through tightly-engineered Spell Cards.
;Vehicles: Obsessed with everything from boats to cars to mecha.
#FUNCTIONS
#DIM DYNAMIC ChildIndex
#DIMS DYNAMIC CheckHobby
WHILE 1
SELECTCASE CheckHobby
	CASE ""
		CheckHobby '= "Robotics"
	CASE "Robotics"
		CheckHobby '= "Architecture"
	CASE "Architecture"
		CheckHobby '= "Explosives"
	CASE "Explosives"
		CheckHobby '= "Weapons"
	CASE "Weapons"
		CheckHobby '= "Danmaku"
	CASE "Danmaku"
		CheckHobby '= "Vehicles"
	CASE "Vehicles"
		; [AUTO-NEUTRALIZED] THROW @K51_EGG_CHILD_HOBBY error with ChildIndex {ChildIndex}, hobby was not assigned.
ENDSELECT
SIF CHILD_TRAIT(51,ChildIndex,CheckHobby)
	RETURNF CheckHobby
WEND

@K51_EGG_CHILD_SET_HOBBY(ChildIndex)
#DIM DYNAMIC ChildIndex
#DIMS DYNAMIC ChildHobby
SIF CHILD_TRAIT(51,ChildIndex,"Robotics,Architecture,Explosives,Weapons,Danmaku,Vehicles")
	RETURN
$TOP
SELECTCASE RAND:5
	CASE 0
		ChildHobby '= "Robotics"
	CASE 1
		ChildHobby '= "Architecture"
	CASE 2
		ChildHobby '= "Explosives"
	CASE 3
		IF CHILD_SEX:51:ChildIndex == 2
			ChildHobby '= "Weapons"
		ELSE
			ChildHobby '= "Danmaku"
		ENDIF
	CASE 4
		ChildHobby '= "Vehicles"
ENDSELECT
SIF ChildIndex < 6 && CFLAG:51:子供人数 < MAXCHILD && FIND_CHILD("51",,ChildHobby) ;The first five children will have unique hobbies.
	GOTO TOP
CALL ADD_CHILD_TRAIT(51,ChildIndex,ChildHobby)

